#NEXUS
[Cladogram: synthetic example for demonstration only, NOT a biological inference.
 All taxa and relationships are fictional.
 Shared synthetic taxa: OTU01 through OTU15; shared strictly binary topology.
 Support values (prob) are fictional numbers for display only, not analysis results.
 No node ages, time anchors, or branch lengths are supplied.
 The rooted topology expresses relationships only, not elapsed time.]
BEGIN TREES;
  TREE fictional_cladogram = [&R]
    ((OTU01,OTU02)[&prob=0.96],
     (((OTU03,OTU04),(OTU05,OTU06)),
      (((OTU07,OTU08),(OTU09,OTU10)),
       ((OTU11,OTU12),(OTU13,(OTU14,OTU15)))))[&prob=0.92]);
END;
